# Play test of Charbone Cove (CIPlay charbone_cove, in a test world 'CI ...'). No quest: the camp behind the palisade and
# the chest by the fire, the bone cave on the east shore and the camp's hoard, the boars, the treasure. Points as in its
# recipe.
island Charbone Cove
offset 0 0
expect animals Hyena 3
expect animals Warthog 2
expect animals Turtle 2
wait 3
kill Hyena
kill Warthog
# The camp's clearing, the chest by the fire
walk -4 -6 to -6 -3 to -7.6 -2.2 h=4 below=6
expect stand -6 -3 h=4 below=5
open Chest by the fire
# The bone cave: in from the east beach to the hoard
walk 44 7 to 38 7 to 32 8 to 27.5 9.5 h=2.1 below=3
expect stand 30 8 h=2.1 below=3
open The camp's hoard
dig
